From 71722495a318fc71dde679aec4e5e93093d9bcc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <apatgaonkar@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 25 Nov 2021 09:49:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[SW-36216] gaudi2: security: add lbw rr apis"

This reverts commit 140c6d50674e9c37d998e9907d8fe5f871018a78.

Change-Id: I2738896a7e198ac5eb519a5f8c232a09e491da41
---

diff --git a/arch/gaudi2/common/Makefile b/arch/gaudi2/common/Makefile
index df93d38..dd1a99d 100644
--- a/arch/gaudi2/common/Makefile
